            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A heat store (10) for an energy storage system, comprising: an inner vessel (40) housing a thermal energy store (14); and an outer vessel (50) surrounding the inner vessel (40), the inner and outer vessels (40, 50) being spaced by a vacuum region (11) extending therebetween.</p>
